         copy was reviewed and drawn, so the description moved. Per LOCALE, not
         per key: fil said "Burahin" against a sheet saying "Alisin", pt-BR said
         "Excluir" against "Remover". Pinned by PackFailureCopyTest in all three. -->
    <string name="offline_cd_delete">Remove %1$s</string>
    <string name="offline_cd_retry">Retry downloading %1$s</string>
    <!-- 17c/17d — the tablet dialog host (#130 PR-16). Three keys, and each one
